<h1>Rename Pages</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">The</span> <span class="Command">Rename</span> <span lang="EN-US">command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Pages &gt; Rename</b></span></i></b> <span lang="EN-US">in</span> <span class="Mode" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Inspection</u></span> <span lang="EN-US">mode, by pressing</span> <span class="Shortcut" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>F2</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">from the keyboard on a selected report page or by simple clicking on a selected page in the list.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">This command renames a single page in the list. When there is no page created in the list this command will be grayed.</span></p>
<p class="Example"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1">Example</a></span><span lang="EN-US" style="text-decoration:none;">:</span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP504228431" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/rename_pages.gif" width="189px" height="62px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Use"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB">Use</span></b> <span class="Command">Rename</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to replace automatically assigned names with your own that will better match to the pages.</span></p>

